INSERT INTO `TarotCard` VALUES (0,'愚者','The Fool','the-fool','major','大阿卡纳','0','INFINITE POTENTIAL','[\"破局启程\",\"纯粹好奇\",\"归零重启\"]','迈出第一步的勇气，本身就是最深奥的智慧。','愚者象征着一切可能性的原点。你感知到的焦虑，实则是潜意识对跳出舒适区的兴奋反应。过多的风险权衡正变成沉重的行囊，让你在起跑线前迟疑不决。','在外界评价与内在感知之间寻求平衡，避免过度自我防卫。','今日留出 15-20 分钟静默时间，在笔记本上梳理当下最核心的 1 个内心关切。','“迈出第一步的勇气，本身就是最深奥的智慧。”','pages/home/cards/card_00_the-fool.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/home/cards/card_00_the-fool.jpg','pages/reading/cards/card_00_the-fool.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/reading/cards/card_00_the-fool.jpg','pages/home/card_back.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/home/card_back.jpg','2026-09-24 02:41:04.563','2026-09-24 02:41:04.563'),(1,'魔术师','The Magician','the-magician','major','大阿卡纳','I','MANIFESTATION','[\"资源整合\",\"创造力量\",\"知行合一\"]','如其在上，如其在下。你已备齐所需的每一块拼图。','所有解决当下难题的工具已经摆在你的桌面上。魔术师提示你，你所欠缺的不是能力与储备，而是将现有零散资源整合并付诸行动的决断力。','在外界评价与内在感知之间寻求平衡，避免过度自我防卫。','今日留出 15-20 分钟静默时间，在笔记本上梳理当下最核心的 1 个内心关切。','“如其在上，如其在下。你已备齐所需的每一块拼图。”','pages/home/cards/card_01_the-magician.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/home/cards/card_01_the-magician.jpg','pages/reading/cards/card_01_the-magician.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/reading/cards/card_01_the-magician.jpg','pages/home/card_back.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/home/card_back.jpg','2026-09-24 02:41:04.564','2026-09-24 02:41:04.564'),(2,'女祭司','The High Priestess','the-high-priestess','major','大阿卡纳','II','INTUITION & DEPTH','[\"直觉内观\",\"静定自守\",\"智慧觉察\"]','在喧嚣静止之处，万物的真相自会浮出水面。','外界的声音过于嘈杂，遮蔽了你敏锐的本能洞察。女祭司提示你：此刻需要的不是向外抓取建议，而是退回内心的静谧之所。','在外界评价与内在感知之间寻求平衡，避免过度自我防卫。','今日留出 15-20 分钟静默时间，在笔记本上梳理当下最核心的 1 个内心关切。','“在喧嚣静止之处，万物的真相自会浮出水面。”','pages/home/cards/card_02_the-high-priestess.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/home/cards/card_02_the-high-priestess.jpg','pages/reading/cards/card_02_the-high-priestess.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/reading/cards/card_02_the-high-priestess.jpg','pages/home/card_back.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/home/card_back.jpg','2026-09-24 02:41:04.565','2026-09-24 02:41:04.565'),(3,'女皇','The Empress','the-empress','major','大阿卡纳','III','ABUNDANCE & NURTURE','[\"丰盛孕育\",\"生命滋养\",\"无私接纳\"]','允许爱自然流淌，生命自会在丰盛中生长。','女皇象征滋养与丰盛的母性力量。无需过度紧绷与自我苛责，善待自己的感受，给予种子足够的发芽时间。','在外界评价与内在感知之间寻求平衡，避免过度自我防卫。','今日留出 15-20 分钟静默时间，在笔记本上梳理当下最核心的 1 个内心关切。','“允许爱自然流淌，生命自会在丰盛中生长。”','pages/home/cards/card_03_the-empress.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/home/cards/card_03_the-empress.jpg','pages/reading/cards/card_03_the-empress.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/reading/cards/card_03_the-empress.jpg','pages/home/card_back.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/home/card_back.jpg','2026-09-24 02:41:04.565','2026-09-24 02:41:04.565'),(4,'皇帝','The Emperor','the-emperor','major','大阿卡纳','IV','STABILITY & ORDER','[\"秩序确立\",\"边界掌控\",\"理性决断\"]','真正的力量，源于内心的秩序与自律。','皇帝代表建立边界与内在权威。审视你当前生活中缺乏秩序的角落，果断做出界定，建立清晰明确的个人规则。','在外界评价与内在感知之间寻求平衡，避免过度自我防卫。','今日留出 15-20 分钟静默时间，在笔记本上梳理当下最核心的 1 个内心关切。','“真正的力量，源于内心的秩序与自律。”','pages/home/cards/card_04_the-emperor.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/home/cards/card_04_the-emperor.jpg','pages/reading/cards/card_04_the-emperor.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/reading/cards/card_04_the-emperor.jpg','pages/home/card_back.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/home/card_back.jpg','2026-09-24 02:41:04.566','2026-09-24 02:41:04.566'),(5,'教皇','The Hierophant','the-hierophant','major','大阿卡纳','V','SPIRITUAL WISDOM','[\"精神启引\",\"价值坚守\",\"传承智慧\"]','倾听内在导师的呼唤，真理无需向外苦寻。','教皇代表传统智慧与精神指引。向有经验的长辈或书籍求教，同时检验那些教条是否真正符合你内心的真实信念。','在外界评价与内在感知之间寻求平衡，避免过度自我防卫。','今日留出 15-20 分钟静默时间，在笔记本上梳理当下最核心的 1 个内心关切。','“倾听内在导师的呼唤，真理无需向外苦寻。”','pages/home/cards/card_05_the-hierophant.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/home/cards/card_05_the-hierophant.jpg','pages/reading/cards/card_05_the-hierophant.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/reading/cards/card_05_the-hierophant.jpg','pages/home/card_back.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/home/card_back.jpg','2026-09-24 02:41:04.567','2026-09-24 02:41:04.567'),(6,'恋人','The Lovers','the-lovers','major','大阿卡纳','VI','HARMONY & CHOICE','[\"同频共振\",\"灵魂共鸣\",\"真诚抉择\"]','每一次真诚的选择，都是灵魂对自我的确认。','恋人牌揭示了价值观的选择与深度链接。在面对分歧或十字路口时，唯有遵循灵魂的真实渴求，才能做出不悔的抉择。','在外界评价与内在感知之间寻求平衡，避免过度自我防卫。','今日留出 15-20 分钟静默时间，在笔记本上梳理当下最核心的 1 个内心关切。','“每一次真诚的选择，都是灵魂对自我的确认。”','pages/home/cards/card_06_the-lovers.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/home/cards/card_06_the-lovers.jpg','pages/reading/cards/card_06_the-lovers.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/reading/cards/card_06_the-lovers.jpg','pages/home/card_back.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/home/card_back.jpg','2026-09-24 02:41:04.568','2026-09-24 02:41:04.568'),(7,'战车','The Chariot','the-chariot','major','大阿卡纳','VII','WILLPOWER & COURAGE','[\"意志破局\",\"驾驭矛盾\",\"勇毅前行\"]','凝聚意志的力量，冲破所有犹豫的藩篱。','战车象征聚焦意志与克服冲突。将内在互相拉扯的动力调整至同一方向，坚定步伐，直面眼前的挑战。','在外界评价与内在感知之间寻求平衡，避免过度自我防卫。','今日留出 15-20 分钟静默时间，在笔记本上梳理当下最核心的 1 个内心关切。','“凝聚意志的力量，冲破所有犹豫的藩篱。”','pages/home/cards/card_07_the-chariot.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/home/cards/card_07_the-chariot.jpg','pages/reading/cards/card_07_the-chariot.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/reading/cards/card_07_the-chariot.jpg','pages/home/card_back.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/home/card_back.jpg','2026-09-24 02:41:04.569','2026-09-24 02:41:04.569'),(8,'力量','Strength','strength','major','大阿卡纳','VIII','INNER RESILIENCE','[\"以柔克刚\",\"接纳本能\",\"内在韧性\"]','温柔拥有穿透坚石的伟力，接纳自身的脆弱。','力量牌提示我们：驯服猛兽靠的不是暴力的压制，而是无条件的接纳与温柔的慈悲。接纳自己的软弱，便是强大的开端。','在外界评价与内在感知之间寻求平衡，避免过度自我防卫。','今日留出 15-20 分钟静默时间，在笔记本上梳理当下最核心的 1 个内心关切。','“温柔拥有穿透坚石的伟力，接纳自身的脆弱。”','pages/home/cards/card_08_strength.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/home/cards/card_08_strength.jpg','pages/reading/cards/card_08_strength.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/reading/cards/card_08_strength.jpg','pages/home/card_back.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/home/card_back.jpg','2026-09-24 02:41:04.570','2026-09-24 02:41:04.570'),(9,'隐士','The Hermit','the-hermit','major','大阿卡纳','IX','SOLITUDE & ILLUMINATION','[\"静默深潜\",\"明灯自照\",\"内求洞见\"]','在孤独中点燃明灯，照亮不被世俗定义的道路。','隐士提醒你适时抽离外界的喧闹。独处不是孤立，而是向内在智慧深潜，在属于你自己的节奏中寻得安宁与澄明。','在外界评价与内在感知之间寻求平衡，避免过度自我防卫。','今日留出 15-20 分钟静默时间，在笔记本上梳理当下最核心的 1 个内心关切。','“在孤独中点燃明灯，照亮不被世俗定义的道路。”','pages/home/cards/card_09_the-hermit.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/home/cards/card_09_the-hermit.jpg','pages/reading/cards/card_09_the-hermit.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/reading/cards/card_09_the-hermit.jpg','pages/home/card_back.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/home/card_back.jpg','2026-09-24 02:41:04.572','2026-09-24 02:41:04.572'),(10,'命运之轮','Wheel of Fortune','wheel-of-fortune','major','大阿卡纳','X','CHANGE & DESTINY','[\"顺势而为\",\"周期回转\",\"拥抱变化\"]','万事万物皆有周期，顺应流动方能把握契机。','命运之轮提示我们生命总在周期性起伏中前行。顺应季节的更迭，处于低谷时蓄力，处于顺境时谦卑，一切皆在流动中。','在外界评价与内在感知之间寻求平衡，避免过度自我防卫。','今日留出 15-20 分钟静默时间，在笔记本上梳理当下最核心的 1 个内心关切。','“万事万物皆有周期，顺应流动方能把握契机。”','pages/home/cards/card_10_wheel-of-fortune.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/home/cards/card_10_wheel-of-fortune.jpg','pages/reading/card