卫。','今日留出 15-20 分钟静默时间，在笔记本上梳理当下最核心的 1 个内心关切。','“结束并非终结，而是为更盛大的新生腾出空间。”','pages/home/cards/card_13_death.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/home/cards/card_13_death.jpg','pages/reading/cards/card_13_death.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/reading/cards/card_13_death.jpg','pages/home/card_back.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/home/card_back.jpg','2026-09-24 02:41:04.576','2026-09-24 02:41:04.576'),(14,'节制','Temperance','temperance','major','大阿卡纳','XIV','BALANCE & HEALING','[\"中道融合\",\"炼金调和\",\"情绪流动\"]','在极端的拉扯中寻找平衡，耐心是最好的淬炼。','节制牌传达着调和与中庸的艺术。在激进与停滞之间寻找呼吸的节奏，通过微调生活习惯，重建身心的动态平衡。','在外界评价与内在感知之间寻求平衡，避免过度自我防卫。','今日留出 15-20 分钟静默时间，在笔记本上梳理当下最核心的 1 个内心关切。','“在极端的拉扯中寻找平衡，耐心是最好的淬炼。”','pages/home/cards/card_14_temperance.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/home/cards/card_14_temperance.jpg','pages/reading/cards/card_14_temperance.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/reading/cards/card_14_temperance.jpg','pages/home/card_back.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/home/card_back.jpg','2026-09-24 02:41:04.576','2026-09-24 02:41:04.576'),(15,'恶魔','The Devil','the-devil','major','大阿卡纳','XV','SHADOW & LIBERATION','[\"直视执念\",\"破除枷锁\",\"阴影整合\"]','看清欲望的锁链，唯有觉察能带来真正的自由。','恶魔牌揭露了潜意识中的恐惧与依赖。觉察那些看似不可或缺的执念，一旦你认清束缚你的锁链并非无懈可击，自由便随之而来。','在外界评价与内在感知之间寻求平衡，避免过度自我防卫。','今日留出 15-20 分钟静默时间，在笔记本上梳理当下最核心的 1 个内心关切。','“看清欲望的锁链，唯有觉察能带来真正的自由。”','pages/home/cards/card_15_the-devil.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/home/cards/card_15_the-devil.jpg','pages/reading/cards/card_15_the-devil.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/reading/cards/card_15_the-devil.jpg','pages/home/card_back.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/home/card_back.jpg','2026-09-24 02:41:04.577','2026-09-24 02:41:04.577'),(16,'高塔','The Tower','the-tower','major','大阿卡纳','XVI','AWAKENING & BREAKTHROUGH','[\"幻象粉碎\",\"剧烈重塑\",\"觉醒契机\"]','当虚妄的高楼崩塌，坚实的真理才得以显现。','高塔象征顿悟与突变。当虚假的安稳被打破，虽然伴随着震荡，但这正是摆脱僵化认知、重建真实自我的最强推力。','在外界评价与内在感知之间寻求平衡，避免过度自我防卫。','今日留出 15-20 分钟静默时间，在笔记本上梳理当下最核心的 1 个内心关切。','“当虚妄的高楼崩塌，坚实的真理才得以显现。”','pages/home/cards/card_16_the-tower.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/home/cards/card_16_the-tower.jpg','pages/reading/cards/card_16_the-tower.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/reading/cards/card_16_the-tower.jpg','pages/home/card_back.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/home/card_back.jpg','2026-09-24 02:41:04.578','2026-09-24 02:41:04.578'),(17,'星星','The Star','the-star','major','大阿卡纳','XVII','HOPE & HEALING','[\"希望重塑\",\"潜能觉醒\",\"自我疗愈\"]','夜色越是幽暗，星光愈是清冽。保持内在确信。','星星牌表明当前的困惑并非绝境，而是精神秩序的更新期。过往沉重的包袱正被渐渐放下，保持像静谧夜空中恒星般的自我光芒。','在外界评价与内在感知之间寻求平衡，避免过度自我防卫。','今日留出 15-20 分钟静默时间，在笔记本上梳理当下最核心的 1 个内心关切。','“夜色越是幽暗，星光愈是清冽。保持内在确信。”','pages/home/cards/card_17_the-star.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/home/cards/card_17_the-star.jpg','pages/reading/cards/card_17_the-star.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/reading/cards/card_17_the-star.jpg','pages/home/card_back.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/home/card_back.jpg','2026-09-24 02:41:04.579','2026-09-24 02:41:04.579'),(18,'月亮','The Moon','the-moon','major','大阿卡纳','XVIII','SUBCONSCIOUS & ILLUSION','[\"潜意识潮汐\",\"直视迷茫\",\"接纳未知\"]','穿透内心的迷雾，接纳潜意识深处的情绪潮汐。','月亮牌揭示了潜意识深层的潮汐与未明的情绪。不要急于寻找确定性的逻辑，允许迷雾存在，倾听梦境与直觉的低语。','在外界评价与内在感知之间寻求平衡，避免过度自我防卫。','今日留出 15-20 分钟静默时间，在笔记本上梳理当下最核心的 1 个内心关切。','“穿透内心的迷雾，接纳潜意识深处的情绪潮汐。”','pages/home/cards/card_18_the-moon.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/home/cards/card_18_the-moon.jpg','pages/reading/cards/card_18_the-moon.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/reading/cards/card_18_the-moon.jpg','pages/home/card_back.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/home/card_back.jpg','2026-09-24 02:41:04.580','2026-09-24 02:41:04.580'),(19,'太阳','The Sun','the-sun','major','大阿卡纳','XIX','VITALITY & CLARITY','[\"生机焕发\",\"纯真喜悦\",\"澄明澄澈\"]','用赤子之心拥抱生活，阳光会驱散一切阴霾。','太阳牌带来毫无保留的生机与热情。驱散心头的阴霾，用赤子般的清澈拥抱生活，将你的温暖与喜悦分享给周围的人。','在外界评价与内在感知之间寻求平衡，避免过度自我防卫。','今日留出 15-20 分钟静默时间，在笔记本上梳理当下最核心的 1 个内心关切。','“用赤子之心拥抱生活，阳光会驱散一切阴霾。”','pages/home/cards/card_19_the-sun.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/home/cards/card_19_the-sun.jpg','pages/reading/cards/card_19_the-sun.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/reading/cards/card_19_the-sun.jpg','pages/home/card_back.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/home/card_back.jpg','2026-09-24 02:41:04.581','2026-09-24 02:41:04.581'),(20,'审判','Judgement','judgement','major','大阿卡纳','XX','REBIRTH & CALLING','[\"灵性召唤\",\"重塑自我\",\"终极释怀\"]','听从内心的审判与召唤，放下过往重获新生。','审判牌宣告自我重生的时刻。放下过去对自己的苛责与懊悔，倾听内心最深切的呼唤，勇敢走出崭新的人生轨迹。','在外界评价与内在感知之间寻求平衡，避免过度自我防卫。','今日留出 15-20 分钟静默时间，在笔记本上梳理当下最核心的 1 个内心关切。','“听从内心的审判与召唤，放下过往重获新生。”','pages/home/cards/card_20_judgement.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/home/cards/card_20_judgement.jpg','pages/reading/cards/card_20_judgement.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/reading/cards/card_20_judgement.jpg','pages/home/card_back.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/home/card_back.jpg','2026-09-24 02:41:04.586','2026-09-24 02:41:04.586'),(21,'世界','The World','the-world','major','大阿卡纳','XXI','COMPLETION & WHOLENESS','[\"圆满达成\",\"万物一体\",\"崭新飞跃\"]','行过千山万水，终在自我圆满中开启新的轮回。','世界牌代表一个重要生命阶段的圆满收官。整合所有的经验与经历，在自我完整与和谐中，踏入下一段更高维度的旅程。','在外界评价与内在感知之间寻求平衡，避免过度自我防卫。','今日留出 15-20 分钟静默时间，在笔记本上梳理当下最核心的 1 个内心关切。','“行过千山万水，终在自我圆满中开启新的轮回。”','pages/home/cards/card_21_the-world.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/home/cards/card_21_the-world.jpg','pages/reading/cards/card_21_the-world.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/reading/cards/card_21_the-world.jpg','pages/home/card_back.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/home/card_back.jpg','2026-09-24 02:41:04.587','2026-09-24 02:41:04.587'),(22,'王牌·权杖','Ace of Wands','ace-of-wands','wands','权杖',NULL,'PASSION & ACTION','[\"权杖\",\"Ace阶位\",\"行动\"]','感知权杖蕴含的行动·意志·创造力力量，在具体的行动中找寻内心节奏。','王牌·权杖（Ace of Wands）提醒你关注生活中的行动·意志·创造力维度。将感知转化为清晰的行动或梳理，踏实走好当下的每一步。','避免在权杖能量中陷入极端，注意与现实生活的平衡。','今天尝试在行动方面做一个具体的微小调整，感受内在状态的微妙变化。','“我与当下的能量流动全然同在，安住于每一步的成长之中。”','pages/home/cards/card_22_ace-of-wands.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/home/cards/card_22_ace-of-wands.jpg','pages/reading/cards/card_22_ace-of-wands.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/reading/cards/card_22_ace-of-wands.jpg','pages/home/card_back.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/home/card_back.jpg','2026-09-24 02:41:04.588','2026-09-24 02:41:04.588'),(23,'二·权杖','Two of Wands','two-of-wands','wands','权杖',NULL,'PASSION & ACTION','[\"权杖\",\"Two阶位\",\"行动\"]','感知权杖蕴含的行动·意志·创造力力量，在具体的行动中找寻内心节奏。','二·权杖（Two of Wands）提醒你关注生活中的行动·意志·创造力维度。将感知转化为清晰的行动或梳理，踏实走好当下的每一步。','避免在权杖能量中陷入极端，注意与现实生活的平衡。','今天尝试在行动方面做一个具体的微小调整，感受内在状态的微妙变化。','“我与当下的能量流动全然同在，安住于每一步的成长之中。”','pages/home/cards/card_23_two-of-wands.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/home/cards/card_23_two-of-wands.jpg','pages/reading/cards/card_23_two-of-wands.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/reading/cards/card_23_two-of-wands.jpg','pages/home/card_back.jpg','https://xinmang-lingjing-tarot.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/pages/home/card_back.jpg','2026-09-24 02:41:04.588','2026-09-24 02:41:04.588'),(24,'三·权杖','Three of Wands